{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>הנה יד ה' הויה.</b> A feminine form of הֹוֶה — for thus one says in the feminine regarding what was in the past: הָיְתָה, and regarding the future: תִּהְיֶה, and regarding the present: הוֹיָה — like עוֹשָׂה, רוֹצָה, רוֹעָה."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:09.857576215Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}